&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;被所有割合&lt;br/&gt;(％)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:71.3pt;min-height:71.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.9pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(連結子会社)&lt;br/&gt;タビオ奈良株式会社&lt;br/&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.9pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;奈良県北葛城郡広陵町&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.9pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:8.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-right:11.4pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;9,000&lt;br/&gt;千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.9pt;padding-right:2.9pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;物流業務、靴下の企画・検査・検品・加工、機械の製造・販売等&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;直接&lt;br/&gt;100.0&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;―&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;当社商品の保管及び物流業務を行っております。&lt;br/&gt;当社より土地の貸与を受けております。&lt;br/&gt;役員の兼任　3名&lt;/p&gt;
