&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:16pt;font-size:16pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:16pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(注)１.　評価性引当額の変動の主な内容は、税務上の繰越欠損金に係る評価性引当金の減少であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:16pt;font-size:16pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:49.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;"&gt;　　２.　繰越欠損金及びその繰延税金資産の繰越期限別の金額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;前連結会計年度(&lt;span&gt;2023年２月28日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
